{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-o058b","title":"水灌下邳与吕布陈宫被杀","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o058b-account","label":"正文","text":"曹操用荀攸、郭嘉计引水灌城，月余后宋宪、魏续等执陈宫降城，吕布、陈宫被擒杀。","evidence":["wudi-e-o058b-q"]},{"id":"lvzang-a-5ecdd541774cb62577b2","label":"正文","text":"太祖堑围三月侯成宋宪魏续缚陈宫以其众降","evidence":["lvzang-q-c2847a531d2132afe2d2"]},{"id":"lvzang-a-1baedb446978a1e4ad2e","label":"正文","text":"布登白门楼兵围急乃下降被生缚","evidence":["lvzang-q-75cbe570c70c5329d02f"]},{"id":"lvzang-a-66136842a118a696acdd","label":"正文","text":"备进言太祖缢杀布宫顺等枭首送许","evidence":["lvzang-q-1d5c9a6c11cb5bec3896"]},{"id":"lvzang-a-b6b1d24ddf409c28ed21","label":"裴注·九州春秋","text":"会太祖围下邳侯成遂领众降","evidence":["lvzang-q-041ab5ab00c4a4c06c3e"]},{"id":"yuanzhang-a-1b9e9aa7b3b3aa0b3531","label":"正文","text":"吕布被诛后袁涣得归太祖","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-6bf1b1254f8ab107a819"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"灌城擒杀","evidence":["wudi-e-o058b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0143","role":"献计","evidence":["wudi-e-o058b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0144","role":"献计","evidence":["wudi-e-o058b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0145","role":"执宫投降","evidence":["wudi-e-o058b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0146","role":"执宫投降","evidence":["wudi-e-o058b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0088","role":"被杀","evidence":["wudi-e-o058b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0096","role":"被杀","evidence":["wudi-e-o058b-q"]},{"person":"lvzang-p0001","role":"布将、缚陈宫将其众降；遂领众降","evidence":["lvzang-q-c2847a531d2132afe2d2","lvzang-q-041ab5ab00c4a4c06c3e"]},{"person":"liu-bei","role":"进曰明公不见布之事丁建阳及董太师乎","evidence":["lvzang-q-1d5c9a6c11cb5bec3896"]},{"person":"wudi-p0140","role":"枭首送许","evidence":["lvzang-q-1d5c9a6c11cb5bec3896"]},{"person":"wudi-p0308","role":"吕布被诛后归太祖","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-6bf1b1254f8ab107a819"]}],"place":{"text":"下邳、泗水、沂水","evidence":["wudi-e-o058b-q"]},"time":{"label":"建安三年（围攻月余后）","year":198,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-o058b-q","wudi-q-o054","wudi-q-b-4269a9733b31c7ed1578"],"chronology":"wudi-y198","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o054","basis":"建安三年（围攻月余后）","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,339,"O058b"],"order":150},{"id":"lvzang-e-o117","title":"顺每谏布布不能用郝萌反后夺顺兵与魏续","accounts":[{"id":"lvzang-a-46e081e2eb10a46ba18c","label":"裴注·英雄记","text":"顺每谏布布不能用郝萌反后夺顺兵与魏续","evidence":["lvzang-q-dbfdaeb2ed7f928bc45e"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0140","role":"每谏布言凡破家亡国非无忠臣明智者也但患不见用耳将军举动不肯详思辄喜言误误不可数也、当攻战仍将续所领兵、终无恨意","evidence":["lvzang-q-dbfdaeb2ed7f928bc45e"]},{"person":"wudi-p0088","role":"知其忠然不能用、从郝萌反后更疏顺、以魏续有外内之亲悉夺顺所将兵以与续","evidence":["lvzang-q-dbfdaeb2ed7f928bc45e"]},{"person":"wudi-p0146","role":"有外内之亲、受顺所将兵","evidence":["lvzang-q-dbfdaeb2ed7f928bc45e"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["lvzang-q-dbfdaeb2ed7f928bc45e"]},"ordering_evidence":"lvzang-q-dbfdaeb2ed7f928bc45e","source_order":[7,126,70],"order":1855}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0146","name":"魏续","evidence":["wudi-q-o058","lvzang-q-c2847a531d2132afe2d2","lvzang-q-dbfdaeb2ed7f928bc45e"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"wudi-m-o058-wudi-p0146","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wudi-q-o058"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"lvzang-q-041ab5ab00c4a4c06c3e","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-3641f77987147c318cae","layer":"pei","quote":"会太祖围下邳，成遂领众降","attribution":"裴注·九州春秋","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":122,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-8e2c5f07165c04d36c9a","start":187,"end":199,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lvzang-q-1d5c9a6c11cb5bec3896","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-66d8ed1a8c5b129739ae","layer":"original","quote":"刘备进曰：“明公不见布之事丁建阳及董太师乎〖8〗！”太祖颔之〖9〗。布因指备曰：“是儿最叵信者〖10〗！”﹝五﹞于是缢杀布〖11〗。布与宫、顺等皆枭首送许，然后葬之","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":99,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":82,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lvzang-q-75cbe570c70c5329d02f","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-89207ecfdd74ae282a34","layer":"original","quote":"布与其麾下登白门楼〖4〗，兵围急，乃下降，遂生缚布","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":98,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":39,"end":64,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lvzang-q-c2847a531d2132afe2d2","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-89207ecfdd74ae282a34","layer":"original","quote":"太祖堑围之三月〖3〗，上下离心。其将侯成、宋宪、魏续，缚陈宫，将其众降","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":98,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":35,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lvzang-q-dbfdaeb2ed7f928bc45e","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-7d0314fe476e3e227dc0","layer":"pei","quote":"顺每谏布，言：‘凡破家亡国，非无忠臣明智者也，但患不见用耳。将军举动，不肯详思，辄喜言误，误不可数也。’布知其忠，然不能用；布从郝萌反后，更疏顺。以魏续有外内之亲，悉夺顺所将兵以与续。及当攻战，故令顺将续所领兵，顺亦终无恨意","attribution":"裴注·英雄记","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":125,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-880e0e85c592af5b5051","start":70,"end":182,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o058b-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-1e667d99069ce89fe4e0","layer":"original","quote":"攻之不下。时公连战，士卒疲，欲还；用荀攸、郭嘉计〖5〗，遂决泗、沂水以灌城〖6〗。月余，布将宋宪、魏续等执陈宫，举城降。生擒布、宫，皆杀之。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":338,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":83,"end":153,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-4269a9733b31c7ed1578","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-4269a9733b31c7ed1578","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗三年：建安三年（公元 198）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":327,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-1273453201e8129c485c","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o054","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-ec1ae0750950ac5532fb","layer":"original","quote":"三年春正月〖1〗，公还许。初置军师祭酒〖2〗。三月，公围张绣于穰。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":323,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":33,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o058","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-1e667d99069ce89fe4e0","layer":"original","quote":"冬十月，屠彭城〖2〗，获其相侯谐。进至下邳，布自将骑逆击〖3〗。大破之，获其骁将成廉，追至城下。布恐，欲降。陈宫等沮其计〖4〗，求救于术，劝布出战。战又败，乃还固守；攻之不下。时公连战，士卒疲，欲还；用荀攸、郭嘉计〖5〗，遂决泗、沂水以灌城〖6〗。月余，布将宋宪、魏续等执陈宫，举城降。生擒布、宫，皆杀之。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":338,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":153,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-6bf1b1254f8ab107a819","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-e051f0c32d3c8e964731","layer":"original","quote":"布诛，涣得归太祖","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":21,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":8,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
